From 21aa79a7f3d6af5c363bb6300f587dd331536a8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:40:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 093/104] refactor(tflite): move the classifier layout and
 image forward into a shared helper

The model-directory layout detection (text vs image, manifest and labels
checks, labels confinement), the label-vs-layout check at load, the
wrong-route 400s, and the /classify/image multipart forward with its error
normalization move from the tflite backend into backends/classifier_backend,
parameterized by the graph file names. tflite's behaviour and messages are
unchanged; test_tflite_layout becomes test_classifier_layout with the same
cases.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
